2026-07-01T20:36:54.5996467Z         """
2026-07-01T20:36:54.5996689Z         The following test is based on a cookie set by Okta, a well-known authorization
2026-07-01T20:36:54.5996893Z         service. It turns out that it's common practice to set cookies that would be
2026-07-01T20:36:54.5996997Z         invalid according to the spec.
