2026-07-01T20:36:54.9258750Z         """
2026-07-01T20:36:54.9259158Z         Test that test client discards domain restricted cookies which do not match the
2026-07-01T20:36:54.9259485Z         base_url of the testclient (`http://testserver` by default).
